-#
-# Shared by the waiting and connected states. The warning is the load-bearing
-# part: regenerating is not additive, it breaks the install that exists.
.module
  %h2 Generate new credentials
  %p Use this if you lost the shared secret, if you are reinstalling the app in Canvas, or if you think someone else has seen it.
  %p
    %strong Generating new credentials immediately stops the current Canvas app from working.
    You will need to paste the new key and secret into Canvas before the wikiedu.org link works again for you or your students.
  = button_to 'Generate new credentials', "/courses/#{course.slug}/canvas",
              method: :post, class: 'button danger',
              data: { confirm: 'This stops your current Canvas app from working until you paste the new key and secret into Canvas. Continue?' }
